# Copy to secrets/backend.env (ignored by Git), permissions 0600 on Linux.
# Generate CANESIGHT_OPERATOR_TOKEN directly on the host using a secure random
# generator; 32..128 ASCII characters, no whitespace. Never paste its value here.
# The bounded backend.server launcher uses the accepted CS-029 session factory.
# Optional Gemini/database keys belong only here once CS-039/042 are integrated.
# No sample credentials are provided and no secrets are passed to the proxy.
# Vision is disabled by default. The reviewed vision overlay sets an absolute
# CANESIGHT_VISION_WEIGHTS path to a verified read-only model mount in the backend.
